  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the Air Cargo Terminal of Queen Alia International Airport in Amman, Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to develop the feasibility studies for the improvement of the air cargo terminal of the international airport in Amman. Specific attention will be paid to the handling of perishable cargo, which requires effective cooling.</narrative>
  </description>
